* Wed Nov 11 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.0
- New: notifications while Rustrx is closed (Settings > Notifications >
  "Keep running in the background", off by default): closing leaves a
  stand-in without a window that stays connected, starts with the phone and
  shows a line in the events view (tap: open, Quit: end).
- New: one notification per room, updated in place; a tap opens the room.
- New: voice messages; audio plays in place, videos on their own page;
  polls with votes; shared locations open in a maps app.
- New: Rustrx in the share sheet; matrix: and matrix.to links open in it;
  cover actions (search, latest unread room).
- New: edit, report, discard failed messages, emoji reactions in the menu,
  who is typing, per-room notification settings, room key export and
  import, create a room, captions under pictures and files, picture
  previews for other clients, an image viewer, Settings > Privacy and
  Storage, "Create an account" on the login page.
- Fixed: reading back through history no longer jumps; logout clears
  everything; the unread badge grows to the left.
- Needs new permissions (Audio, Microphone, Videos, Music, User services):
  Sailfish asks once on the first start.

* Wed Nov 11 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.2.2
- New: a page for each room (swipe left in a conversation): name and topic,
  address, encryption, favourite and low priority, members with direct chat
  and ignore, invite and leave.
- New: reactions toggle with a tap; mentions are marked; addresses in plain
  messages are links.
- Fixed: the room's header stays at the top; "Mark as read" from the room
  list works; spinners instead of empty-page texts while loading; no endless
  reloading at the start of a room's history.
- Fixed: the session file is owner-only and written in one piece; clean
  shutdown; no room names in the system log; reproducible builds (lock file).

* Tue Nov 10 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.2.1
- Fixed: sessions survive the server's token rotation (0.2.0 lost the session
  after a restart); when a server ends a session, the app returns to login.
- Fixed: sync resumes after a network loss; the cover shows the right state;
  direct chats show the other person's picture; unread counts match other
  clients; leaving a room and removing a message work again.
- New: rows show the last message, its age, the unread count on the avatar,
  favourites and encrypted rooms; read receipts (switchable); round avatars
  (switchable); Add Room / Contact; reply quotes; a reminder line while the
  device is unverified.

* Mon Nov 09 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.2.0
- First release: login with password, rooms, people and favourites, text,
  replies, reactions, images and files, photos from the built-in camera,
  emoji verification, history restore with the recovery key, key backup,
  drafts, cover, notifications while running.
